WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A clock has two hands. Let’s give each hand just one job.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Find the short orange hand. It points to three. Its job is to tell us the hour.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Now find the long blue hand. Its job is to tell us the minutes.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.000
When the long hand points straight up to twelve, there are zero minutes past the hour.

5
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Short hand at three. Long hand at twelve. Put those together: three o’clock.

6
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Your turn: point to the hour hand. Then point to the minute hand. Pause the video if you like.
